{"segs": ["PA_vv_71:0.1", "PA_vv_71:0.2"], "en": "Vimānavatthu: The Mansion of the Man,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:59:09Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_vv_71:0.3"], "en": "Chapter on Pāyāsi", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:59:09Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_vv_71:0.4", "PA_vv_71:1.1", "PA_vv_71:1.2"], "en": "7. The Story of the Celestial Mansion of the Barley-Tender “High is this celestial mansion with its jeweled pillars... [as before] ...”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:59:09Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_vv_71:1.3"], "en": "\"And your complexion shines in all directions.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:59:09Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_vv_71:2.1", "PA_vv_71:2.2"], "en": "That son of the gods, being delighted... [as before]...", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:59:09Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_vv_71:2.3"], "en": "The fruit of which action is this:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:59:09Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_vv_71:3.1"], "en": "\"Among humans, having become a human being,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:59:09Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_vv_71:3.2"], "en": "I was once a barley-keeper.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:59:09Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_vv_71:3.3"], "en": "I saw a stainless bhikkhu,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:59:09Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_vv_71:3.4"], "en": "serene and untroubled;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:59:09Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_vv_71:4.1"], "en": "to him I gave my portion.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:59:09Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_vv_71:4.2"], "en": "With serene hearts and my own hands,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:59:09Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_vv_71:4.3"], "en": "having given a lump of rice-gruel,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:59:09Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_vv_71:4.4"], "en": "I rejoice in the Nandana Grove.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:59:09Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_vv_71:5.1", "PA_vv_71:5.2"], "en": "\"Because of that, my complexion is such as this...", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:59:09Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_vv_71:5.3"], "en": "and my complexion shines forth in all directions.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:59:09Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_vv_71:6.1"], "en": "The Yavapālaka Vimāna is the seventh.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:59:09Z"}
]
